{%- comment -%}
NF-MEMBERS-V1 gating (2026-09-27). members-only: non members see the product but get "Members only" instead of Add to cart.
early-access + product metafield custom.early_access_until: before that time non members get "Early access for members",
members get the normal button and an Early access badge. Pages are cached, so assets/nf-membership.js re-checks the time and
flips the button when the public release passes.
SECURITY NOTE (for Joe): this is cosmetic on non Plus plans. Someone could still post a variant id to /cart/add. The backstop is
the Flow rule "Order created: line item tagged members-only or early-access and customer lacks tag member -> tag the order
review-member-gate and email Joe". Discounts themselves are enforced by Shopify (segment Active members) and cannot be spoofed.
NF-TRADE (2026-10-16/17): Nora Members became Nora Trade. Trade accounts (customer tag `trade`) pass the gates too, and
the wording and links point to the Trade Program (snippets/nf-trade-url.liquid).
No product is tagged members-only or early-access today, so nothing shows unless those tags are used again.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign nf_mtag = settings.nf_mem_tag | default: 'member'
  assign nf_is_member = false
  if customer and customer.tags contains nf_mtag
    assign nf_is_member = true
  endif
  if customer and customer.tags contains 'trade'
    assign nf_is_member = true
  endif
  assign nf_gate_hard = false
  assign nf_gate_soft = false
  assign nf_ea_ts = 0
  if settings.nf_mem_enabled
    if product.tags contains 'members-only' and nf_is_member == false
      assign nf_gate_hard = true
    endif
    if product.tags contains 'early-access' and product.metafields.custom.early_access_until != blank
      assign nf_ea_ts = product.metafields.custom.early_access_until | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      assign nf_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if nf_ea_ts > nf_now and nf_is_member == false
        assign nf_gate_soft = true
      endif
    endif
  endif
-%}
{%- if nf_gate_hard -%}
<div class="nf-gate">
  <p class="nf-gate__t"><span class="nf-gate__lock" aria-hidden="true"></span>Trade only</p>
  <p class="nf-gate__s">This piece is available to Nora Trade accounts.</p>
  <a class="nf-gate__btn" href="{%- render 'nf-trade-url' -%}" data-nf-mem-cta="gate">Join Trade Program</a>
</div>
{%- else -%}
{%- if nf_gate_soft -%}
<div class="nf-gate" data-nf-ea-gate data-until="{{ nf_ea_ts }}">
  <p class="nf-gate__t">Early access for Nora Trade</p>
  <p class="nf-gate__s">Public release {{ product.metafields.custom.early_access_until | date: '%B %-d at %-I:%M %p' }}.</p>
  <a class="nf-gate__btn" href="{%- render 'nf-trade-url' -%}" data-nf-mem-cta="early">Join Trade Program</a>
</div>
{%- elsif nf_is_member and nf_ea_ts > 0 -%}
<p class="nf-ea-badge">Early access · Nora Trade until {{ product.metafields.custom.early_access_until | date: '%B %-d' }}</p>
{%- endif -%}
<div class="nf-atc-wrap" {% if nf_gate_soft %}hidden data-nf-ea-atc{% endif %}>
{%- comment -%}
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  BUY BUTTONS
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  This component is used to show the buy buttons

  ********************************************
  Supported variables
  ********************************************

  * product: the product from which to show the buttons (if empty, a placeholder is displayed)
  * show_payment_button: if we show or not the dynamic checkout button
  * show_gift_card_recipient: for gift card products, an optional message/email to be sent to the recipient
  * atc_button_background: the background of the ATC button
  * atc_button_text_color: the color of the ATC button
  * payment_button_background: the background of the dynamic payment button
  * payment_button_background: the color of the dynamic payment button
  * form_id: if specified, define the form ID linked to this input
  * show_quantity: NF-BUYBOX-V2 (2026-09-14): when true, renders the quantity selector inline, to the left of the
    Add to Cart button, instead of as its own separate row above. Only passed as true from the main product page.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign variant_picker_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'variant_picker' | first
    # NF-CHEAPEST-V2: render the variant main-product chose (cheapest available on a bare product URL)
    assign nf_iv = nf_initial_variant | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant
    assign recipient_feature_active = false

    if product.gift_card? and show_gift_card_recipient
      assign recipient_feature_active = true
    endif
  -%}

  <product-form>
    {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id -%}
      {%- comment -%}NF-ORDERINFO-V1 hidden line item properties, enabled by the panel in custom-nav.js{%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign nf_oi = product.metafields.custom.order_info.value
      -%}
      {%- if nf_oi != blank -%}
        <div class="nf-oi-data" hidden data-nf-oi="{{ nf_oi | json | escape }}"></div>
        {%- for f in nf_oi.fields -%}
          <input type="hidden" disabled data-nf-oi-field="{{ f.k }}" name="properties[{{ f.l }}]" value="">
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      <input
        type="hidden"
        {% if variant_picker_block != blank %}
          disabled
        {% endif %}
        name="id"
        value="{{ nf_iv.id }}"
      >

      {% liquid
        assign button_disabled = false

        if nf_iv == null
          assign button_disabled = true
          assign button_content = 'product.general.unavailable_button' | t
        elsif nf_iv.available == false
          assign button_disabled = true
          assign button_content = 'product.general.sold_out_button' | t
        else
          if product.template_suffix contains 'pre-order'
            assign button_content = 'product.general.pre_order_button' | t
          elsif show_quantity
            # NF-ATC-STEADY (2026-10-19, owner: every option click "retypes" Add to Cart): on the product page the label is
            # rendered with its price, exactly as snippets/nf-pdp-quality-badges.liquid writes it ("Add to Cart - $392.99"),
            # so the button the theme swaps in on an option change already reads right; that script only corrects the
            # price for quantity and Bundle & Save, and only when the text really differs.
            # v10 (owner 2026-10-25): inside the Fall Hosting window the label shows the price after the $ off the cart
            # will apply ($50 off $400+, $150 off $1,000+), same rule as snippets/nf-pdp-quality-badges.liquid, so the
            # first paint already matches and nothing retypes. Only on pieces that show the bundle tiers (not Room Sets
            # or the membership).
            assign nf_atc_p = nf_iv.price
            unless product.type == 'Room Set' or product.tags contains 'membership-product' or product.gift_card?
              capture nf_pd
                render 'nf-promo-dates'
              endcapture
              assign nf_pd_f = nf_pd | strip | split: '|' | first | split: ','
              assign nf_pd_s = nf_pd_f[0] | plus: 0
              assign nf_pd_e = nf_pd_f[1] | plus: 0
              assign nf_pd_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
              if nf_pd_now >= nf_pd_s and nf_pd_now <= nf_pd_e
                if nf_atc_p >= 100000
                  assign nf_atc_p = nf_atc_p | minus: 15000
                elsif nf_atc_p >= 40000
                  assign nf_atc_p = nf_atc_p | minus: 5000
                endif
              endif
            endunless
            assign nf_atc_money = nf_atc_p | money
            assign button_content = 'Add to Cart - ' | append: nf_atc_money
          else
            assign button_content = 'product.general.add_to_cart_button' | t
          endif
        endif
      %}

      <div class="v-stack gap-4 nf-bb-stack">
        {%- if recipient_feature_active -%}
          <gift-card-recipient class="gift-card-recipient v-stack gap-3">
            {%- assign checkbox_label = 'gift_card.recipient.checkbox' | t -%}
            {%- render 'checkbox', label: checkbox_label, name: 'properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_recipient]' -%}

            <div class="gift-card-recipient__fields" hidden>
              <div class="fieldset">
                {%- liquid
                  assign recipient_email_label = 'gift_card.recipient.email_label' | t
                  render 'input', type: 'email', label: recipient_email_label, name: 'properties[Recipient email]', value: form.email, required: true, maxlength: 138

                  assign recipient_name_label = 'gift_card.recipient.name_label' | t
                  render 'input', label: recipient_name_label, name: 'properties[Recipient name]', value: form.name

                  assign send_on_label = 'gift_card.recipient.send_on_label' | t
                  render 'input', type: 'date', label: send_on_label, name: 'properties[Send on]', value: form.send_on, pattern: '\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}'
                  render 'input', type: 'hidden', name: 'properties[__shopify_offset]'

                  assign message_label = 'gift_card.recipient.message_label' | t
                  render 'input', label: message_label, name: 'properties[Message]', value: form.message, multiline: 3, maxlength: 200, show_max_characters_count: true
                -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          </gift-card-recipient>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="{% if show_quantity %}nf-qty-atc-row{% endif %}">
          {%- if show_quantity and product.available -%}
            <div class="nf-qty-inline">
              {%- render 'quantity-selector', variant: nf_iv, form: form_id -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <buy-buttons class="buy-buttons nf-buybuttons" form="{{ form_id }}">
            {%- if nf_iv.available == false or show_payment_button and atc_button_background == blank and atc_button_text_color == blank -%}
              {%- assign atc_button_style = 'outline' -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- assign atc_button_style = 'solid' -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- render 'button',
              content: button_content,
              type: 'submit',
              disabled: button_disabled,
              style: atc_button_style,
              background: atc_button_background,
              text_color: atc_button_text_color,
              stretch: true
            -%}
          </buy-buttons>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} NF-BUYNOW-V1 (2026-09-14): Shopify's native dynamic checkout button. Renders the store's
          enabled express wallets (Shop Pay / PayPal / Apple Pay / Google Pay, whichever are turned on in Payments
          settings) plus Shopify's own "More payment options" link beneath it, which goes to the regular checkout
          where every payment method can be chosen. Only rendered when the block setting turns it on and the
          variant can actually be purchased. Sits as its own full width row below quantity + Add to Cart. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if show_payment_button and button_disabled == false -%}
          <div class="nf-buynow">
            {{- form | payment_button -}}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} NF-PDP-1108 (2026-11-08, owner: "the X people viewed in the last 24 hours needs to be right underneath Buy with Shop"): the viewers line renders here, main form only; the nf_urgency template block is now empty. Backup: assets/_bak_buy-buttons.liquid_bf5d_20261108.txt {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if form_id contains 'product-form-main-' and button_disabled == false -%}
          {%- render 'nf-pdp-head', product: product, part: 'urgency' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- comment -%} NF-TRUSTED-V1 (2026-10-25): social-proof pill under Buy with Shop + Add to Cart,
          above the low-stock / viewed-count line. Main product form only (not sticky bar, not quick buy),
          and only when the product can actually be purchased. See snippets/nf-trusted.liquid. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- comment -%} NF-PDP-VIDEO (2026-11-10, owner: "remove the trusted by 50K customers section ... put that video there"):
          the Trusted by 50K+ pill is gone; the product video shows here instead, main form only. Products with no video show
          nothing. To bring the pill back, render 'nf-trusted' here again. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if form_id contains 'product-form-main-' -%}
          {%- render 'nf-pdp-video', product: product -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endform -%}
  </product-form>
{%- else -%}
  <buy-buttons class="buy-buttons" template="{{ product.template_suffix | escape }}" form="{{ form_id }}">
    {%- assign button_content = 'product.general.add_to_cart_button' | t -%}
    {%- render 'button',
      content: button_content,
      type: 'submit',
      background: variant_picker_block.settings.atc_button_background,
      text_color: variant_picker.settings.atc_button_text_color,
      stretch: true
    -%}
  </buy-buttons>
{%- endif -%}

</div>
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} 2026-10-25 (owner: "put the quantity on the left side of the add to cart ... the big space above it doesn't look good"):
  quantity and Add to Cart share one row, no "Quantity" caption, same height. {%- endcomment -%}
