{%- comment -%} NF-PAGEWEIGHT-1108: the inline <script> that was here (NF-PDP-R4 anchor (was rendered twice)) now ships in assets/nf-pdp-bundle.js, loaded once from layout/theme.liquid on product pages. Backup of this file: assets/_bak_buy-buttons.liquid_pageweight_20261108.txt {%- endcomment -%}
